Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.05,0:51:13.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we learn a policy based on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.95,0:51:16.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,And what we can do then is data augmentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.72,0:51:21.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,And essentially then the robot is able to replicate exactly the same skill but with rotation of the letters,
