Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.56,0:56:46.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you can see that our controller is able to do that for a wide set of different initial condition and target regulation poses.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.24,0:56:51.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um based on that we actually wanted to investigate if we can truly account for the infinite dimensionality
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.73,0:56:57.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,of the deformable objects and we took inspiration from uh the dynamics of a continuum mechanics to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.72,0:57:01.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,So essentially in that case we are going towards infinite dimensional manifolds.
