Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.22,1:07:31.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,but in my mind this is my opinion if you think about it when you want strong guarantees but then you simplify the model you
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.82,1:07:39.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,are anyway soft guarantees so it's debatable I would say with this art an art guarantee where your model is highly simplified so we are
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.92,1:07:44.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,basically in between of this spectrum between you know formal methods which
