Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.68,1:07:59.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is something that again we started with Antonio Frankie long time ago now in 2018.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.10,1:08:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we said let's say we have a model of a robot whatever it is we just have to know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.76,1:08:06.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then we have some tracking task.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.80,1:08:11.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want to track a trajectory and we have some controller whatever it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.06,1:08:11.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.46,1:08:17.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now the point here is that the model of the robot has some parameters P that we don't know and the
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.20,1:08:24.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,controller uses some nominal value of these parameters and there is a mismatch between the real parameters and the nominal ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.40,1:08:26.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So we want to optimize the trajectory.
