Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.05,1:08:30.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We don't want to build a fancy controller.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.40,1:08:36.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,We take whatever we have but we want to optimize the motion the trajectory such that the closed loop
