Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.45,1:09:41.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if you can do that this can be computed you for integrated and you get your matrix.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.93,1:09:44.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay there is nothing to invent at this stage.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.59,1:09:47.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,So now once you have this matrix you can set up an optimization problem.
